  "question": {
    "text": "Let $x_{1}, x_{2}, \\ldots, x_{13}$ be 15 distinct numbers chosen from $1,2,3, \\ldots, 15 .$ Then, the value of $\\left(x_{1}-1\\right)\\left(x_{2}-1\\right)\\left(x_{3}-1\\right) \\ldots\\left(x_{15}-1\\right)$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
