  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, $x_{1}, x_{2} \\ldots, x_{15}$ are among $1,2,3, \\ldots, 15$. So, $x_{1}$ can take any value from $1,2,3, \\ldots, 15$. Among these values, one of the number must be 1, hence product will be 0",
